Third-party JavaScript bundled into this directory
==================================================

These files are vendored copies of npm packages, served to the offscreen WebView
that DocxModule.kt uses to render a .docx for printing. They are not fetched at
runtime and there is no network access from that WebView.

jszip.min.js
    JSZip 3.10.2 - https://github.com/Stuk/jszip
    Dual licensed under the MIT license or GPLv3.
    Retrieved from the npm package `jszip@3.10.2` (dist/jszip.min.js).
    docx-preview reads the OOXML package through it, and this viewer page uses
    it to read word/document.xml when detecting page orientation.

docx-preview.min.js
    docx-preview 0.4.0 - https://github.com/VolodymyrBaydalka/docxjs
    Released under the Apache License 2.0.
    Retrieved from the npm package `docx-preview@0.4.0` (dist/docx-preview.min.js),
    with the trailing `//# sourceMappingURL=` comment removed so the WebView does
    not request a .map file that is not shipped in the APK.

To update either one: `npm pack <package>@<version>`, take the file named above
from `dist/`, re-strip the sourceMappingURL comment if present, and bump the
version named here. There are no build-time steps and no package.json entry -
these are static assets under `android/app/src/main/assets/`, so they are picked
up by the Android build with no gradle change.

Note that docx-preview renders untrusted document content, so the WebView hosting
it is treated as hostile - see the comment on DocxAssetWebViewClient.kt.
